Build fixes for the PACE-2019 WeGotYouCovered solver (vc_solver) on a
Python-3-only Linux box with no static argtable2:
  * SConstruct: Python 2 print statements -> Python 3 print().
  * SConscript: link vc_solver against the SHARED libargtable2 (--static
    fails, only the shared lib ships) and against gomp instead of gcov;
    rpath the in-tree argtable dir. Dir('#...') anchors the path at the
    project root, else the 'optimized/' variant dir is prepended.
Generated from the tree used for the paper experiments.

